From a4a5ee31b538a283dfa9e49b0820814b6274bf8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:09:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [FAS] Enforce integrity grants in the QTI
 backend

Move fasqtid to IFasBackend V3 and bind CPU vote submissions to the current
daemon, backend, collector and policy grant. Report challenged status and reject
stale contexts or broken boot continuity.

Record the first submission for the boot and expose explicit release-attempt
state without asserting hardware completion. Add the required boot-property,
collector access and vendor manifest integration, together with control models.

Change-Id: Icf7ef16bb7d858858da8ab2acb02c4dd82cc8548
